    "notes": [
      "The full raw reports identified by rawReviewSha256 were reviewed locally; all four samples retain their container format and every valid sample retains its core General, Video, and Audio stream types.",
      "Accepted changes include unit/date spelling normalization, stable field renames, a more specific AAC codec identifier, and additional H.264 settings, VP9 HDR/color metadata, FLAC compression/MD5 data, and embedded-cover Image detection.",
      "The malformed 20240726.mp4 remains a General-only MPEG-4 result in both engines; MediaInfoLib 26.05 no longer emits the legacy IsTruncated=Yes diagnostic, which is recorded as an upstream diagnostic change rather than a stable plugin API guarantee.",
      "The parsing baseline is the verified installed v1.1.0 app whose libmediainfo.so is byte-identical to the frozen Release asset. The old minified v1.1.0 Release wrapper cannot load that engine, remains frozen, and motivated a mandatory minified-release AIDL smoke gate for v2.",
      "No reviewed difference requires a compatibility shim or blocks the official-source migration."
    ]
